{title: Praise to the Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal (1985) #1, LOBE DEN HERREN, harm. W. S. Bennett}
{key: F}
{time: 3/4}
{comment: Source: owner's photo of the printed page (2026-10-17), cross-checked with frazras 001.mid}
{comment: Full harmony: a chord on every syllable where the four parts change. "~" marks a change inside a held syllable.}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Praise [Dm]to [C/E]the [F]Lord, [C]the [Dm]Al-[Am]might-[Bb]y, [F]the [Bb]King [Edim/G]of [Dm]cre-[Gm7/Bb]a ~[C] ~[C7] -[F]tion!
[F]O [Dm]my [C/E]soul, [F]praise [C]Him, [Dm]for [Am]He [Bb]is [F]thy [Bb]health [Edim/G]and [Dm]sal-[Gm7/Bb]va ~[C] ~[C7] -[F]tion!
[F]All [C/E]ye [F]who [Bb]hear, [F]Now [Bb/D]to [C/E]His [F]tem-[Gm]ple [F/A]draw [C]near;
[F/A]Join [Bb]ye [Edim/G]in [Dm]glad [Gm/Bb]ad-[A]o-[Gm]ra ~[C] -[F]tion!
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Guitar (simplified): Edim/G played as C7, slash basses dropped, passing tones dropped.}
{start_of_verse: Verse 1 (guitar)}
[F]Praise [Dm]to [C]the [F]Lord, [C]the [Dm]Al-[Am]might-[Bb]y, [F]the [Bb]King [C7]of [Dm]cre-[Gm7]a ~[C] ~[C7] -[F]tion!
[F]O [Dm]my [C]soul, [F]praise [C]Him, [Dm]for [Am]He [Bb]is [F]thy [Bb]health [C7]and [Dm]sal-[Gm7]va ~[C] ~[C7] -[F]tion!
[F]All [C]ye [F]who [Bb]hear, [F]Now [Bb]to [C]His [F]tem-[Gm]ple [F]draw [C]near;
[F]Join [Bb]ye [C7]in [Dm]glad [Gm]ad-[A]o-[Gm]ra ~[C] -[F]tion!
{end_of_verse}
